<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29184" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δύσ-κρῐτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hard to discern</i> or
				<i>interpret</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄστρων δύσεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					458
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κληδόνες</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				486
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀνείρατα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					981
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				949
			</span></i> (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. νοῦσοι</span>
			<i>hard to determine, doubtful</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Aph.</u>
				3.8
			</span></i>; but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δύσκριτα ἐγένετο</span>
			there was an <i>obscure crisis</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				3.12
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. ἐστι πότερον . . ἢ</span> .
			. <i>difficult of solution</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Aph.</u>
				1.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				433c
			</span></i>. Adv. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τως</span>
			<i>doubtfully, darkly</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				662
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. ἔχειν</span> to be <i>in
				doubt</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ra.</u>
				1433
			</span></i>.</div>
